### LangGraph — the node graph, final

```
triage(state) → intent
  ├─ "command"  → skill_match(persona_access filter) → execute → format
  ├─ "skill"    → skill_match → execute → format
  ├─ "rag"      → rag_node(pgvector default | graphdb if team=host)
  │                → agentic_retry(if score<0.6, reformulate, retry once)
  │                → synthesize(Claude, cached prompt) → gates → eval_score → format
  ├─ "live"     → live_data_node(MCP connector) → format (NO LLM)
  ├─ "report"   → report_node(Report Service, validated data) → synthesize(narrate only) → format
  └─ "no_match" → draft_skill_node(log gap, draft, stage) → graceful fallback → format
```

