```
**Exit condition**: rows inserted, zero duplicate `chunk_id`s, cosine sanity check passes (paraphrase pairs >0.85, unrelated <0.4).

### STAGE 4 — LangGraph skeleton

Build `app/agents/graph.py` per the node diagram in Part A. Mock `synthesize` initially if the Anthropic key isn't wired yet.

