```
**Exit condition**: adversarial cross-team query (TC-1.2) correctly denied and logged.

### STAGE 9 — Connectors, one at a time

Jira → Confluence (embed path) → SharePoint (delegated OAuth, live, never embedded) → ServiceNow → Splunk. Each verified in isolation via curl before the next.

**Exit condition**: each connector's dedicated test passes before starting the next.

### STAGE 10 — Frontend + BFF (`ForgeUI`)

